        "content": "<p>adamrk opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14468\">PR #14468</a> from <code>adamrk:abk/lower-without-fiber</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When lowering the result of a host function, we do the lowering on a separate fiber because it may call realloc which could yield and it's unsound for that to occur outside of a fiber.</p>\n<p>But if we can determine from the result type that lowering will not realloc, then we can immediately lower in the host task future. This PR introduces that optimization.</p>\n<p>I see a ~20% improvement in the benchmark for calling an async noop function which yields.</p>\n<p>Baseline:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">host</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">pending</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">once</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                        </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.0301</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">2.0645</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">2.1008</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Branch:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">host</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">pending</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">once</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                        </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.6673</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.6984</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.7309</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                        </span><span class=\"n\">change</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"err\">−</span><span class=\"mf\">22.923</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">−</span><span class=\"mf\">21.135</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">−</span><span class=\"mf\">19.370</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.00</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.05</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                        </span><span class=\"n\">Performance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">has</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">improved</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>&lt;!--<br>\nPlease make sure you include the following information:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>If this work has been discussed elsewhere, please include a link to that<br>\n  conversation. If it was discussed in an issue, just mention \"issue #...\".</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Explain why this change is needed. If the details are in an issue already,<br>\n  this can be brief.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Our development process is documented in the Wasmtime book:<br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.wasmtime.dev/contributing-development-process.html\">https://docs.wasmtime.dev/contributing-development-process.html</a></p>\n<p>Please review the Bytecode Alliance's AI tool usage policy at<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/governance/blob/main/AI_TOOL_POLICY.md\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/governance/blob/main/AI_TOOL_POLICY.md</a></p>\n<p>Please ensure all communication follows the code of conduct:<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a><br>\n--&gt;</p>\n</blockquote>",
